    "summary": "Errata to the second paragraph of the Immolator's Transport section. As the Declare Battle Formations step begins, you may pick 1 **BATTLE SISTERS SQUAD**, **DOMINION SQUAD** or **SISTERS NOVITIATE SQUAD** of yours and split it into 2 units with model counts as equal as possible, noting which models form each. After the split:\n\n- if the unit had the Cherub ability, only 1 new unit may use it in the battle, and you note which\n- 1 new unit must begin the battle inside this **TRANSPORT**\n- the other may begin inside another **TRANSPORT** or be deployed on its own",
